    "name": "Ninja Party",
    "steam_appid": 3186180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/639179b39cf07f6aeabaa6b3b3c36c13.webp?t=1753962366\" width=678 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/5daf9aceb55b423becb7feea33c08f5b.poster.avif?t=1753962366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/5daf9aceb55b423becb7feea33c08f5b.webm?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/5daf9aceb55b423becb7feea33c08f5b.mp4?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run on walls, catch up with opponents and deal with them like a real ninja: using katanas, kunai, hammers, and anything that comes to hand \u2014 even a frying pan. Did you fail and get dealt with? Immediately return to the game and punish the offender, no boring waiting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/13f21d258a252534a44eaea2b57d7f0e.webp?t=1753962366\" width=678 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/333abb0573b441eb16de81694277c3c4.poster.avif?t=1753962366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/333abb0573b441eb16de81694277c3c4.webm?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/333abb0573b441eb16de81694277c3c4.mp4?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remain the only one among 12 contenders for the title of the best ninja. Complete challenges in various modes one by one<strong> </strong>\u2014 try ninja party royale experience. As each stage progresses, opponents are out, and in the end, there is only one winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/327cbb700419cd9238ad859bd48ab05f.webp?t=1753962366\" width=678 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/3319e0362df3efa7e9c7f0b7d8cc12f0.poster.avif?t=1753962366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/3319e0362df3efa7e9c7f0b7d8cc12f0.webm?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/3319e0362df3efa7e9c7f0b7d8cc12f0.mp4?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend and lead your small ninja clan to victory. Cover your friend's back and become the best ninjas together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/9edc6b4cdeb6471d0e8bc923bf02adbb.webp?t=1753962366\" width=678 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/1f785e52589c87c9a786bdf6a3179304.poster.avif?t=1753962366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/1f785e52589c87c9a786bdf6a3179304.webm?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/1f785e52589c87c9a786bdf6a3179304.mp4?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just play and replenish your collection of skins and upgrade those you liked the most \u2014 improve their appearance by reaching new levels. Build your ninja collection!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/639179b39cf07f6aeabaa6b3b3c36c13.webp?t=1753962366\" width=678 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/5daf9aceb55b423becb7feea33c08f5b.poster.avif?t=1753962366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/5daf9aceb55b423becb7feea33c08f5b.webm?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/5daf9aceb55b423becb7feea33c08f5b.mp4?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run on walls, catch up with opponents and deal with them like a real ninja: using katanas, kunai, hammers, and anything that comes to hand \u2014 even a frying pan. Did you fail and get dealt with? Immediately return to the game and punish the offender, no boring waiting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/13f21d258a252534a44eaea2b57d7f0e.webp?t=1753962366\" width=678 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/333abb0573b441eb16de81694277c3c4.poster.avif?t=1753962366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/333abb0573b441eb16de81694277c3c4.webm?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/333abb0573b441eb16de81694277c3c4.mp4?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remain the only one among 12 contenders for the title of the best ninja. Complete challenges in various modes one by one<strong> </strong>\u2014 try ninja party royale experience. As each stage progresses, opponents are out, and in the end, there is only one winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/327cbb700419cd9238ad859bd48ab05f.webp?t=1753962366\" width=678 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/3319e0362df3efa7e9c7f0b7d8cc12f0.poster.avif?t=1753962366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/3319e0362df3efa7e9c7f0b7d8cc12f0.webm?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/3319e0362df3efa7e9c7f0b7d8cc12f0.mp4?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with a friend and lead your small ninja clan to victory. Cover your friend's back and become the best ninjas together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/9edc6b4cdeb6471d0e8bc923bf02adbb.webp?t=1753962366\" width=678 height=48 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/1f785e52589c87c9a786bdf6a3179304.poster.avif?t=1753962366\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/1f785e52589c87c9a786bdf6a3179304.webm?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3186180/extras/1f785e52589c87c9a786bdf6a3179304.mp4?t=1753962366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just play and replenish your collection of skins and upgrade those you liked the most \u2014 improve their appearance by reaching new levels. Build your ninja collection!</p>",
